Q("The remarks law states:", ["Remarks are optional", "Every journal narrates itself — what happened, why this entry, what evidence", "One word suffices", "Only large journals explain"], 1, "A storyless journal is testimony without a witness.", "Ch2"),
Q("The reviewer's five questions are:", ["Amount, date, tax, bank, total", "Who, what accounts, which direction, when, and why", "Debit, credit, balance, period, type", "None"], 1, "Thirty seconds per entry; failures earn the second look.", "Ch2"),
